IDEAS, NO CODE
--------------
Send to a device takes its ideas from two native apps; no code from either
is in this project, and neither can run in a browser.
LocalSend — Apache-2.0 — https://github.com/localsend/localsend
  Sending straight to a device nearby, and the receiver accepting first.
qrcp — MIT — https://github.com/claudiodangelis/qrcp
  Pairing two devices by scanning a QR code.

